<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In the church of Jesus there is life for you,</l><l>Warm as summer sunshine, sweet as morning dew;</l><l>Why should you be fearful, why take anxious thought,</l><l>Since the church of Jesus cares for those He bought?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the church of Jesus there is work for you;</l><l>Such as even angels might rejoice to do;</l><l>Why stand idly sighing for some life work grand,</l><l>While the church of Jesus seeks your reaping hand?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In the church of Jesus there’s a place for you;</l><l>Glorious, bright, and joyous, right and peaceful too;</l><l>Why then like a wand’rer, roam with weary pace,</l><l>If the church of Jesus holds for you a place.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
